{"id":"n70755-1-10","stage":3,"title":"이하 · 以下","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70755-1-10-1","ko":"오늘 보고 온 전시회는 어땠어?","zh":"今天去参观的展览怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"보고","meaning":"照，看","explanation":"보다：照，看；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보고","audio":"/audio/ddf2aaf35f3c5a087464.mp3"}},{"text":"온","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"온","audio":"/audio/dcc56310451956332238.mp3"}},{"text":"전시회는","meaning":"展示会","explanation":"전시회：展示会；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"전시회","audio":"/audio/2238ab819aaac418f808.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31692","senseId":"1","lemma":"전시회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전시회는","audio":"/audio/c67b1cf58d788e0dcd9e.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어","audio":"/audio/fd7f0c90fa72bdb46939.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"照，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了了解某对象的内容或状态而进行观察。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"2238ab819aaac418","term":"전시회","zh":"展示会","audio":"/audio/2238ab819aaac418f808.mp3","entryId":"31692","definition":"展示各种物品供人们前来观看的聚会或活动。","pronunciation":["전ː시회","전ː시훼"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f82ef17e6aebd5bab49.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70755-1-10-2","ko":"별로였어. 작품들이 죄다 수준 이하더라고.","zh":"不太好。那些展品全都是水平很低的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"별로였어.","meaning":"不怎么样，不太好（过去）","explanation":"별로이다：口语中表示“不怎么样、不太好”；这里独立作谓语，不能直译为“特别”。였 表示过去。","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별로였어","audio":"/audio/2511ac93b0972bafdd14.mp3"}},{"text":"작품들이","meaning":"作品","explanation":"작품：作品；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"작품","audio":"/audio/eec1d8d2d561e94f9208.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24837","senseId":"2","lemma":"작품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작품들이","audio":"/audio/f0045736b24c66c90aa0.mp3"}},{"text":"죄다","meaning":"全都、全部","explanation":"죄다：全都、全部。","readings":[{"term":"죄다","audio":"/audio/2ad30e383a713d5a5337.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:죄다:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄다","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄다","audio":"/audio/2ad30e383a713d5a5337.mp3"}},{"text":"수준","meaning":"水准，水平","explanation":"수준：水准，水平。","readings":[{"term":"수준","audio":"/audio/7a73f940083f5fda6132.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15767","senseId":"1","lemma":"수준","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수준","audio":"/audio/7a73f940083f5fda6132.mp3"}},{"text":"이하더라고.","meaning":"以下","explanation":"이하：以下；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"이하","audio":"/audio/1c6e8666efb556a46cde.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70755","senseId":"1","lemma":"이하","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이하더라고","audio":"/audio/c1940c029ca726b03357.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ebf90bac22cca4cd","term":"별로","zh":"不怎么样，不太好","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3","entryId":"58301","definition":"不怎么样，不太好","pronunciation":["별로"]},{"id":"eec1d8d2d561e94f","term":"작품","zh":"作品","audio":"/audio/eec1d8d2d561e94f9208.mp3","entryId":"24837","definition":"画、雕刻、小说、诗等通过艺术创作活动制成的东西。","pronunciation":["작품"]},{"id":"2ad30e383a713d5a","term":"죄다","zh":"全都、全部","audio":"/audio/2ad30e383a713d5a5337.mp3","definition":"作为副词表示没有遗漏地全部；本课按作品全部不好的语境补充。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"7a73f940083f5fda","term":"수준","zh":"水准，水平","audio":"/audio/7a73f940083f5fda6132.mp3","entryId":"15767","definition":"判断事物的价值或质量等的标准程度。","pronunciation":["수준"]},{"id":"1c6e8666efb556a4","term":"이하","zh":"以下","audio":"/audio/1c6e8666efb556a46cde.mp3","entryId":"70755","definition":"数量或程度比一定的基准小或少。","pronunciation":["이ː하"]}],"audio":"/audio/20a2df69f7ecc5c3a26e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.871,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70755","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":103,"sequenceScore":2.6977,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今天去参观的展览怎么样？","不太好。那些展品全都是水平很低的。","从早上开始就有好事发生啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天去参观的展览怎么样？","不太好。那些展品全都是水平很低的。","从早上开始就有好事发生啊？"],"answer":1}]}
